{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09612","headline":"登千福寺楚金禅师法华院多宝塔 · 岑参","name":"登千福寺楚金禅师法华院多宝塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多宝灭已久，莲华付吾师。\n宝塔凌太空，忽如涌出时。\n数年功不成，一志坚自持。\n明主亲梦见，世人今始知。\n千家献黄金，万匠磨琉璃。\n既空泰山木，亦罄天府赀。\n焚香如云屯，蟠盖珊珊垂。\n悉窣神绕护，衆魔不敢窥。\n作礼覩灵境，焚香方证疑。\n庶割区中缘，脱身恒在兹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}